    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pantry Raid is a rogue lite dungeon-crawler with cooking elements. Players traverse the pantry, defeating food-themed enemies to make meals to improve your character during the course of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-energy combat where quick reflexes and sharp strategy are key. With dynamic enemies, fluid movement, and ever-changing buff combinations, every battle is a thrilling test of skill. Dodge, strike, and adapt in the heat of the pantry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized levels and dynamic buff combinations, ensuring no two playthroughs are ever the same. Adapt to shifting strategies as new buffs reshape your play-style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each buff ties to a flavorful element\u2014like Spicy for fire attacks or Salty for ice defenses\u2014leading to unexpected synergies. Adapt, experiment, and master these dynamic power-ups to dominate the pantry!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adorable crew of cooking critters! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pantry Raid is a rogue lite dungeon-crawler with cooking elements. Players traverse the pantry, defeating food-themed enemies to make meals to improve your character during the course of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-energy combat where quick reflexes and sharp strategy are key. With dynamic enemies, fluid movement, and ever-changing buff combinations, every battle is a thrilling test of skill. Dodge, strike, and adapt in the heat of the pantry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized levels and dynamic buff combinations, ensuring no two playthroughs are ever the same. Adapt to shifting strategies as new buffs reshape your play-style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each buff ties to a flavorful element\u2014like Spicy for fire attacks or Salty for ice defenses\u2014leading to unexpected synergies. Adapt, experiment, and master these dynamic power-ups to dominate the pantry!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adorable crew of cooking critters! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
